.SH NAME
ivcap-account-revoke-capability - Revoke one or more capabilities from an account member


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBivcap account revoke-capability account_id --user  --capability  ... [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Revoke individual account capabilities from a user, leaving their remaining
capabilities intact. To remove a member from the account entirely, use
\&'ivcap account remove-member'.


